<title>UK: Chrysler prices $200 mln March 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>Chrysler prices $200 mln March 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager UBS, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHRYSLER FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    06.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.74    PAY DATE   L27.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.59     SPREAD	+23 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A3	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    0.225 PCT SELL CONC   1.15 PCT</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND W/I THREE-YEAR TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
